  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If the parallelogram is a rhombus, the distance between pair of parallel sides is equal.<br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>26</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the minimum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
